  Lines:
  - Speaker: {fileID: 0}
    TextKey: note_preta_01
    DefaultText: The hunger of a Preta stems from the karma and greed accumulated through its past deeds. One should make merit by pouring water in dedication to the deceased whenever the opportunity arises.
    VoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8cc53fe02fd1d8e4a82baa4ed1bbf679, type: 3}
    FallbackDuration: 0
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9fb32e08e48d39f4f9d4bf3ae661839a, type: 2}
    TextKey: note_preta_02
    DefaultText: I'll try pouring water. Maybe it'll work.
    VoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    FallbackDuration: 0
